      "topic": "Closed-loop control of inference quality from runtime signals (formal control-theoretic framing)",
      "rationale": "HERALD's stated phase-2/3 goal is closed-loop control of compression aggressiveness, but the bibliography contains only proto-controller proposals (asrkfegr, dynamickv, thinkv) without any genuine MPC/RL-formulated controller for inference. Worth flagging that the appendix cannot fully position HERALD's eventual control thesis from this bibliography alone.",
