      "topic": "Survival/hazard modeling for sequence prediction outside the medical domain",
      "rationale": "HERALD uses discrete-time hazard modeling with a configurable horizon. The bibliography has no methodological reference for hazard-with-horizon as a sequence prediction primitive in NLP, so the methodology section will rely on hazard textbooks or domain papers not in this list.",
      "suggested_papers": []
    },
